	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Maria "Vildhjärta" Westerberg</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			Maria Westerberg, known by her artist name <strong>Vildhjärta</strong> ("wild heart"), was
			born in Sunne and is known for what she calls "stick art" — sculpture and jewelry made
			from sticks she's collected on long walks through the forest, born from years of
			reconnecting with nature after living abroad.
		</p>
		<p>
			She's opened a permanent outdoor exhibition, the <strong>Pinnskogsreservatet</strong>
			("Stick Forest Reserve"), at Brunskogs hembygdsgård — worth a search online before you go,
			as opening times vary by season.
		</p>
	</div>
